# Notification Center: panel at the right under the bar (x≈1530..1912 Material, 1544..1912 Glass); read rows from the first shot
look material
wait 2
setup notify-send -a Firefox -i firefox 'Download finished' 'report.pdf'
setup notify-send -a Firefox -i firefox 'Download finished' 'slides.pdf'
setup notify-send -a Files -i org.gnome.Nautilus -A open=Open 'Copied' '3 files'
wait 1
ipc panels open notificationCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot nc-open
note card rows from the shot; for the first card (centre cx, cy):
note drag 1/4 of its width right and release: springs back (~300 ms)
note flick: glide 120 px in 80 ms then up: dismissed
note drag past 1/3: flies off in 150 ms, gone
ipc panels close
